                                "id": "0,2,0,0",
                                "type": 4,
                                "elements": "A differentiated rate by periods (stepped over time). The rate (in fractions of 1) is valid for a corresponding time interval (in fractions of a year), and interest is capitalized at the end of each period. The sizes of the rate arrays and periods must be equal.",
